A||||5||deceler8||Dremel vs. saber saw...carving pumpkins||||1||
Z||000000||deceler8||10-27-2000||10:14 AM||||Dremel offers more control, saber saw (variable speed) is quicker.<P>Wish I could post photos...damn pumpkins already rotted due to the very warm weather.<P>Saber saw with a fine wood cutting blade works best. I just had some kids trace the outline on the pumpkins and used the saw to cut them out. Took just minutes.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cooter||10-27-2000||10:28 AM||||One word:<BR>Chainsaw||||reg||1
Z||000002||Tigger||10-27-2000||10:40 AM||||A flash of genius just hit me...  well sort of  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Anyone try using one of those drill bits you use to drill into drywall and walk the bit around to make cutouts for electrical outlets.  I bet one of those would work on a pumpkin too.<P>or how about one of these?<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.toolsforless.com/dewalt/DW309K.jpg"> <P><BR>||||reg||3
Z||000003||deceler8||10-27-2000||11:40 AM||||Some idiot on one of the morning shows was carving his pride and joy...about a 600 pound pumpkin that I'm sure he just about slept with for six months (I won't go any farther than that)  with little hand saws and my first thought was this guy should either get a SpiraCut or a Sawzall.<P>The SpiraCut would probably beat the saber saw and Dremel hands down.||||reg||1
Z||000004||sluppy123||10-27-2000||06:08 PM||||For quickness and accuracy I'd clamp the pumpkin in a CNC mill and give him a face at 32,000 RPM and 1500 IPM.<P>------------------<BR>-Brian S. <BR>Lincoln, NE<BR>85' SC & 87' GT-Leather, Lowered and On The Bottle||||reg||10
Z||000005||Haze_Performance||10-28-2000||05:05 AM||||I have you all beat. I have the Speed & Control........ ROTOZIP Baby, ROTOZIP  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I knew that damn thing would come in handy one day...lol<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2d_00010aa3.gif"> <BR><B>Website's  <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.WS6Fiero.com</A>-                  <A HREF="http://www.hazeperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.HazePerformance.com </A></B>||||reg||12
